WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:08.341
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.035 --> 00:37.037
[thrilling music playing]

01:07.817 --> 01:10.820
[Jin] I hear you have been taking Uk
fishing these days.

01:12.238 --> 01:14.949
[Master Lee] Indeed.
It's boring to go alone, after all.

01:16.242 --> 01:17.619
You said previously

01:18.119 --> 01:21.456
that Uk's destiny follows
the same path as Master Seo Gyeong's.

01:22.040 --> 01:24.667
Is that why you are guiding him?

01:25.502 --> 01:28.421
The one guiding him is not me.

01:30.799 --> 01:32.967
If not you, then is there someone else?

01:34.052 --> 01:34.886
Who then?

01:36.179 --> 01:37.680
You seem to know who it is.

01:44.521 --> 01:48.066
There is no mage teaching Uk
how to cast spells separately.

01:48.650 --> 01:49.651
Let me assure you.

01:50.235 --> 01:52.946
The servant who is always
at his side is an informant of mine.

01:53.696 --> 01:57.826
Sure. So, you are saying he improved
this much on his own without training?

01:57.909 --> 01:59.869
Yes. He managed to become
a Jeongjingak mage,

01:59.953 --> 02:02.330
but it's just through pure luck
and petty tricks. No doubt!

02:02.413 --> 02:03.915
Only those who had reached Chisu--

02:03.998 --> 02:06.793
Did you hear about it as well?
The bet I made with Jang Uk?

02:06.876 --> 02:08.086
[Go Won scoffs]

02:08.169 --> 02:10.296
- He hasn't won once.
- [Jin Mu chuckles]

02:11.297 --> 02:12.257
Indeed!

02:12.340 --> 02:15.885
If he had a master, surely they would have
stopped him from sparring out of shame.

02:16.553 --> 02:19.097
He was getting a lot of attention
reading The Words of the Heart,

02:19.180 --> 02:21.182
but that feat was buried by my gold toads.

02:21.266 --> 02:24.227
True! Yet, seeing the way
he continues to keep fighting,

02:24.853 --> 02:26.437
it seems as though

02:27.564 --> 02:30.316
that item proves to be
very precious to him.

02:33.695 --> 02:35.446
You're all right? Are you able to see?

02:35.530 --> 02:37.407
[Mu-deok] Yes, I can see fine now.

02:37.490 --> 02:39.576
And you? Are you injured, Young Master?

02:41.202 --> 02:42.287
Indeed.

02:43.955 --> 02:46.833
I had no idea
the jade was so important to him.

02:51.504 --> 02:52.839
Once Uk returns,

02:53.715 --> 02:55.967
Beom would want to have
their match right away.

02:56.050 --> 02:57.427
But Uk is busy fishing right now?

02:58.303 --> 03:00.513
And Mu-deok is just letting him do that?

03:00.597 --> 03:03.141
Gosh! I doubt she would have let him.

03:03.224 --> 03:06.728
So, you also see that the only person
Uk listens to is Mu-deok.

03:06.811 --> 03:10.773
No matter what other people pressure him
to do, he can never budge.

03:10.857 --> 03:12.817
He only listens to
what Mu-deok has to say.

03:15.862 --> 03:18.531
We can also choose to protect
the monsters from this world.

03:20.450 --> 03:22.702
[Seo Yul] The monster
he was talking about was Naksu.

03:24.954 --> 03:28.958
If the way to protect her
is to find the ice stone…

03:31.920 --> 03:34.380
- Those two can't be together.
- [Dang-gu] Hmm?

03:35.757 --> 03:36.716
But why?

03:36.799 --> 03:39.427
Do you really not approve
Mu-deok being together with Uk?

03:41.846 --> 03:42.680
No.

03:43.348 --> 03:46.726
Because if these two end up
going down a path, unaware of its danger,

03:48.937 --> 03:51.147
there will be nothing
I can do to stop them.

04:00.365 --> 04:05.995
[Jin] Uk was born with a fate
that could bring chaos into this world.

04:07.580 --> 04:11.459
What if we support and raise him
into an uncontrollable individual,

04:11.542 --> 04:14.003
and he draws the full attention
of the entire world?

04:14.087 --> 04:17.423
Are you afraid he will want
to become king as his fate describes

04:17.507 --> 04:20.593
and bring chaos and destruction
to Daeho and all of its people?

04:22.095 --> 04:25.348
It may be possible
if he learns of the King's Star.

04:25.932 --> 04:27.350
The way he views the world

04:27.976 --> 04:32.522
and his desire to achieve greatness
will increase boundlessly without a doubt.

04:34.274 --> 04:35.316
Jin. [sighs]

04:35.400 --> 04:36.234
[Jin exhales deeply]

04:36.317 --> 04:38.820
How long did it take you to reach Chisu?

04:39.737 --> 04:40.655
Chisu?

04:41.197 --> 04:44.325
It didn't take me long to reach Ryusu,

04:44.409 --> 04:48.705
but it did take quite a bit of time
to reach the level of Chisu.

04:53.918 --> 04:56.754
[Jin] It took me three years
to master the sky's energy,

04:57.839 --> 05:00.258
three years to master the land's,

05:01.634 --> 05:05.680
and four years to feel
the energy around me.

05:08.433 --> 05:12.437
The energy from the sky, the land,
and the water that bridges them.

05:13.313 --> 05:16.316
It took me ten years to master them all

05:18.401 --> 05:20.361
and finally reach Chisu.

05:20.445 --> 05:21.529
That's incredible.

05:22.613 --> 05:24.324
It took me three more years than that.

05:24.407 --> 05:26.617
And it took Yeom twice as long.

05:27.327 --> 05:31.247
I was one of the fastest after Jang Gang.

05:31.748 --> 05:32.665
But you must know…

05:40.590 --> 05:44.218
We say this energy flows
between the heavens and earth.

05:44.302 --> 05:47.722
But in fact, it's only water.

05:50.099 --> 05:53.770
It took us over ten years to finally
understand the essence of the energy

05:53.853 --> 05:54.812
is water.

05:56.397 --> 05:58.900
But there are those
who can feel it from birth.

06:01.360 --> 06:03.362
[dramatic music playing]

06:16.167 --> 06:18.628
[Master Lee]
Simply put, they are extraordinary.

06:19.545 --> 06:21.047
But to the world,

06:21.798 --> 06:24.759
they seem reckless and unreliable,

06:25.593 --> 06:27.678
even dangerous at times.

06:31.516 --> 06:32.350
Did I…

06:33.726 --> 06:35.019
Did I just reach Chisu?

06:38.439 --> 06:41.400
[Master Lee] This is because
they are truly different.

06:48.825 --> 06:51.160
Some could be jealous and envious of them…

06:58.918 --> 07:01.504
while others could be worried
and concerned for them.

07:04.006 --> 07:05.424
I'll win tomorrow for sure…

07:08.177 --> 07:09.220
because I caught it.

07:09.303 --> 07:11.305
[victorious music playing]

07:11.889 --> 07:12.765
You did?

07:13.683 --> 07:14.517
Jang Uk.

07:15.852 --> 07:17.061
You have reached Chisu.

07:19.188 --> 07:20.398
[laughs softly]

07:20.481 --> 07:21.357
[laughs softly]

07:22.316 --> 07:25.111
[Master Lee] Because we do not know
how they will use

07:25.194 --> 07:26.946
their immense, frightening power,

07:27.530 --> 07:31.534
we cannot be sure if they will save
this world as Master Seo Gyeong did,

07:31.617 --> 07:34.996
or plunge it into utter chaos,
sunk in darkness.

07:36.205 --> 07:37.623
So are you trying to say

07:38.958 --> 07:42.003
you will continue to merely watch him?

07:43.838 --> 07:47.133
There's no need to worry.
I'm debating as well.

07:49.385 --> 07:51.262
If we have to get rid of Jang Uk,

07:52.555 --> 07:55.099
I will do so with my own hands.

07:55.183 --> 07:57.185
[intense stinger plays]

08:02.064 --> 08:03.983
[mage] Hey, Uk, is your probation over?

08:04.066 --> 08:05.318
Yes. That's why I'm back.

08:05.401 --> 08:06.819
I hear you destroyed Cheonbugwan.

08:06.903 --> 08:08.154
Don't exaggerate.

08:09.280 --> 08:11.991
- Oh.
- So, finally back.

08:12.742 --> 08:15.661
You know your final opponent will be me.

08:16.329 --> 08:18.664
- Mm.
- Because of that…

08:19.707 --> 08:23.920
there's no way
you'll be able to win. So sorry!

08:29.383 --> 08:30.801
Since you are my last opponent,

08:31.469 --> 08:33.471
I don't want my last match to be too dull.

08:34.722 --> 08:35.806
Do your best!

08:37.808 --> 08:38.643
[scoffs]

08:44.815 --> 08:45.691
[scoffs]

08:45.775 --> 08:47.235
What the hell?

08:47.318 --> 08:49.070
Did he master something when he was gone?

08:49.153 --> 08:51.072
I heard all he's been doing is fishing.

08:51.155 --> 08:53.241
Don't worry. He's delusional.

08:54.617 --> 08:58.788
I'll absolutely crush him
right in front of the Crown Prince.

09:00.831 --> 09:01.916
[Mu-deok] Your Royal Highness.

09:02.750 --> 09:05.545
My foolish young master has lost
nine matches so far,

09:05.628 --> 09:09.298
causing you to lose
nine of your gold toads.

09:10.049 --> 09:12.385
I don't deserve to look you
in the eye, Your Highness.

09:14.762 --> 09:16.222
One match left, right?

09:16.305 --> 09:18.099
Yes. He trained hard for it.

09:18.182 --> 09:20.518
So Jang Uk will not
disappoint you this time, Sire.

09:20.601 --> 09:22.228
If he doesn't wish to disappoint me,

09:22.812 --> 09:23.896
he needs to lose today.

09:28.484 --> 09:30.570
You thought I was a fool, didn't you?

09:31.153 --> 09:34.198
I know you were using my gold
to train your young master.

09:35.741 --> 09:37.243
Thanks to the matches,

09:37.326 --> 09:40.580
you got to watch my annoying
young master be humiliated, right?

09:41.330 --> 09:43.916
In my humble opinion,
it was worth the price.

09:44.750 --> 09:45.960
It was entertaining.

09:46.502 --> 09:48.254
I hope he loses this match also,

09:49.589 --> 09:51.299
so I can see you cry later.

09:52.717 --> 09:54.677
Uk has the other half of this pair, right?

09:55.678 --> 09:57.763
If these were shared
between the two of you,

09:58.264 --> 10:00.141
I guess this must be a token of love.

10:02.768 --> 10:04.562
You gave up something
like this just to use me?

10:08.649 --> 10:11.277
If Uk loses and this jade becomes mine,

10:11.902 --> 10:12.987
I will destroy it.

10:14.447 --> 10:17.033
You should also lose something.
How pitiful!

10:17.950 --> 10:20.244
Your heart-wrenching love
will be thrown away.

10:22.413 --> 10:23.497
[sighs]

10:25.541 --> 10:26.959
Do as you wish.

10:27.960 --> 10:29.337
That jade did its job

10:29.420 --> 10:31.088
allowing him to have ten duels.

10:31.172 --> 10:32.798
Didn't you say this jade is more valuable

10:32.882 --> 10:34.717
than anything in the world?
Even your own life?

10:35.968 --> 10:38.471
If we've shown
we'd risk our lives for each other,

10:39.847 --> 10:43.225
then just losing that would not make
our feelings disappear.

10:50.399 --> 10:52.735
So you really don't care
if you lose this then?

10:54.195 --> 10:55.029
Fine.

10:56.280 --> 10:57.448
I'll just toss it now.

11:02.078 --> 11:02.912
[exhales deeply]

11:08.167 --> 11:09.752
So it really did mean nothing.

11:10.878 --> 11:12.880
Then you have deceived me.

11:12.963 --> 11:15.257
You said you were betting
what is most important to you.

11:15.341 --> 11:16.967
But if you do not care
that it's been tossed,

11:17.051 --> 11:18.177
then you have lied to me.

11:19.470 --> 11:21.055
How will you pay for what you did?

11:21.680 --> 11:23.140
You said you'd bet your life?

11:24.100 --> 11:24.934
Good.

11:26.060 --> 11:28.729
This time, place yourself for the bet.

11:30.606 --> 11:32.691
I already lost
nine gold toads because of you.

11:33.317 --> 11:34.777
I don't want to lose one more.

11:34.860 --> 11:36.612
So, the reward for this next duel…

11:37.905 --> 11:38.739
is you.

11:41.659 --> 11:42.785
Do as you wish.

11:43.285 --> 11:44.453
If Uk loses this time,

11:45.413 --> 11:48.374
then your master will no longer
be Jang Uk, but whoever beats him.

11:49.625 --> 11:52.920
Yes, understood, Your Royal Highness.

12:02.513 --> 12:03.764
[breathes angrily]

12:08.769 --> 12:11.021
So you are Uk's last opponent?

12:13.023 --> 12:14.608
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

12:14.692 --> 12:16.402
I will do my best to win this duel.

12:17.528 --> 12:18.696
You must win.

12:19.280 --> 12:20.281
If you lose the duel,

12:20.906 --> 12:23.576
I'll see to it
that you never succeed in life as a mage.

12:25.411 --> 12:27.329
Give me your word you'll win this.

12:28.581 --> 12:31.625
A lot could happen in a duel, uh--

12:31.709 --> 12:32.543
Enough!

12:33.961 --> 12:36.255
I need someone who will win for sure.

12:36.338 --> 12:37.173
Say you'll win.

12:37.798 --> 12:39.675
I'm afraid I can't say that for certain,

12:40.426 --> 12:41.927
because no one expected him…

12:43.929 --> 12:45.473
to defeat you either, Sire.

12:47.099 --> 12:50.519
There's only one person here
who can say with utmost certainty

12:51.604 --> 12:52.688
they can win against him.

12:53.272 --> 12:54.190
It is Seo Yul.

12:55.274 --> 12:57.276
[upbeat music playing]

13:00.237 --> 13:01.155
Seo Yul.

13:14.126 --> 13:15.836
The bet started as nothing serious.

13:17.087 --> 13:18.672
But now it has gone too far.

13:19.173 --> 13:23.677
I spent, what? Nine gold toads just
to put that arrogant prick in his place.

13:24.261 --> 13:27.306
Imagine by some chance,
something unexpected happens in the match,

13:27.806 --> 13:31.602
and he actually ends up winning.
How ridiculous will I look?

13:33.729 --> 13:35.731
I need someone to win the last duel.

13:35.814 --> 13:38.484
And I believe that you,
my cousin, are truly

13:38.567 --> 13:40.027
the best mage in Jeongjingak

13:41.737 --> 13:44.740
I know that you
and Jang Uk are very close.

13:46.742 --> 13:48.160
But could you help out the Crown Prince

13:48.244 --> 13:50.162
and your cousin
just this one time, please?

13:50.955 --> 13:52.289
I've never asked for anything.

13:56.418 --> 13:57.628
It'll be me.

13:59.922 --> 14:00.756
Really?

14:01.924 --> 14:03.884
You'll actually fight this guy for me?

14:04.468 --> 14:05.678
Yes. I'll win, Sire.

14:06.387 --> 14:07.846
I give you my word.

14:07.930 --> 14:08.931
[chuckles]

14:09.014 --> 14:12.476
That's right. Very good! Very good! Yes.
You-- you of all people can do that.

14:12.560 --> 14:16.855
Did Mu-deok really promise to serve
whichever mage that can beat Uk?

14:16.939 --> 14:19.567
Yes. Yes.
Instead of betting the gold toad…

14:24.655 --> 14:26.657
she decided to
put herself up as the prize.

14:26.740 --> 14:28.534
Then I have to beat Uk and…

14:30.077 --> 14:31.829
take her in as my servant.

14:32.955 --> 14:34.874
[intense music playing]

14:36.375 --> 14:37.334
[Go Won] Let's get started.

14:38.127 --> 14:40.546
The mage who is fighting
Jang Uk today, step forward.

14:42.131 --> 14:42.965
[exhales deeply]

14:45.009 --> 14:47.011
[pensive music playing]

14:58.480 --> 15:00.524
[intense music playing]

15:08.824 --> 15:09.825
Jang Uk.

15:10.910 --> 15:12.786
The person you have to fight against today

15:13.495 --> 15:14.330
will be me.

15:14.830 --> 15:16.999
[intense music continues playing]

15:34.016 --> 15:37.019
Yul wouldn't have volunteered.
Did Yul volunteer just to let Uk win?

15:37.102 --> 15:38.062
[Yeol] No way.

15:38.145 --> 15:41.148
When Dang-gu volunteered,
Uk refused to fight him then, too.

15:41.231 --> 15:42.775
[Beom] He will not let Uk win.

15:42.858 --> 15:45.736
He gave the Crown Prince his word
that he would beat Uk.

15:50.658 --> 15:51.492
You may begin.

15:51.992 --> 15:54.244
[action music playing]

16:03.420 --> 16:04.254
[Jang Uk grunts]

16:06.924 --> 16:07.841
[Dang-gu] Yul was right.

16:08.926 --> 16:11.095
Uk really has improved quite a lot.

16:12.429 --> 16:13.263
[Jang Uk pants]

16:26.110 --> 16:27.528
That's my signature shield spell.

16:27.611 --> 16:28.737
When did Jang Uk master it?

16:30.572 --> 16:33.325
[Beom] He's merely borrowing
his opponents' moves.

16:33.409 --> 16:36.161
Has he somehow mastered all
of his opponents' spells and techniques?

16:37.162 --> 16:39.790
He's learned his opponents' spells
from previous matches little by little.

16:40.332 --> 16:41.166
Perfect!

16:44.670 --> 16:45.921
[both grunting]

16:50.634 --> 16:51.510
[pants]

16:52.219 --> 16:54.138
[action music continues playing]

17:16.160 --> 17:18.162
[epic music playing]

17:41.226 --> 17:42.227
He has done it.

17:42.853 --> 17:44.897
[epic music continues playing]

17:58.744 --> 17:59.620
[Jang Uk grunts]

18:01.663 --> 18:02.581
[Jang Uk grunts]

18:03.499 --> 18:04.583
[groans, pants]

18:08.837 --> 18:11.048
[breathes heavily]

18:12.925 --> 18:13.801
[groans]

18:17.679 --> 18:19.848
The match has ended.

18:19.932 --> 18:22.434
Seo Yul has won.

18:23.852 --> 18:24.686
[groans]

18:25.270 --> 18:26.105
[laughs]

18:26.605 --> 18:27.689
I knew Yul would win.

18:29.191 --> 18:32.611
[Beom]
In the end, Uk lost all ten matches.

18:32.694 --> 18:33.904
- [Beom laughs]
- How did he use Tansu

18:34.404 --> 18:35.656
near the end of the match?

18:35.739 --> 18:38.784
[Yeol] He gathered the energy in the air
and turned it into water.

18:38.867 --> 18:39.785
Don't lie.

18:40.702 --> 18:43.413
Only those
who have reached Chisu can do that.

18:45.415 --> 18:46.500
[exhales in relief]

18:46.583 --> 18:47.459
[groans in frustration]

18:48.585 --> 18:49.419
[grunts]

18:51.672 --> 18:53.132
[breathes heavily]

18:56.009 --> 18:57.219
When did you reach Chisu?

18:57.845 --> 19:01.515
I told you yesterday, did I not?
That you were going to be surprised.

19:01.598 --> 19:03.058
- Truly incredible.
- [Jang Uk exhales]

19:03.851 --> 19:06.186
- Good job!
- Jang Uk!

19:07.187 --> 19:09.648
- You have reached Chisu. Congratulations!
- Hey! Hey!

19:09.731 --> 19:11.608
- [Jang Uk groans]
- [Dang-gu exclaims] Did you all see that?

19:12.234 --> 19:14.945
Our fellow mage, Uk,
finally achieved Chisu!

19:15.028 --> 19:16.196
[mage 1 laughs] Amazing!

19:16.280 --> 19:18.031
[mages] Amazing! Amazing! Congratulations!

19:18.115 --> 19:20.075
[mages cheering]

19:20.159 --> 19:22.619
- [mage 2] You are amazing.
- [Dang-gu] Congratulations!

19:22.703 --> 19:23.537
Hey! Hey!

19:24.037 --> 19:24.872
Oh, God.

19:24.955 --> 19:26.456
To Sejukwon. Let's go. Let's go.

19:27.040 --> 19:28.876
- [groans]
- [mage 3] So amazing!

19:35.757 --> 19:38.218
Mu-deok left
with the Crown Prince just now.

19:38.844 --> 19:41.471
It was their bet,
so they're probably putting an end to it.

19:41.555 --> 19:44.224
I'm just worried she will make
another ridiculous bet with him.

19:44.308 --> 19:45.559
I will go and check on her.

19:46.059 --> 19:49.563
That's a very good idea. You should go
and take care of Mu-deok from now on, Yul.

19:53.692 --> 19:56.111
That is what we want
the Crown Prince to think, after all.

19:58.155 --> 20:00.782
[Dang-gu]
Yeah. So, come with me to Sejukwon.

20:00.866 --> 20:02.618
And, Seo Yul, you go see Mu-deok.

20:02.701 --> 20:04.244
And Uk, let's go, let's go, let's go.

20:04.328 --> 20:06.496
Hurry! [groans] All right. Oh, no!
Oh, oh, oh!

20:06.580 --> 20:08.540
- [Dang-gu] Watch out. Careful. Careful.
- [Jang Uk] That hurts.

20:08.624 --> 20:10.125
- [Dang-gu] Careful! Careful! Sorry.
- [Jang Uk] Ugh!

20:15.255 --> 20:19.426
Just as you said,
my young master has lost all ten times.

20:20.052 --> 20:21.845
You have won, Your Royal Highness.

20:22.721 --> 20:24.473
You already knew
what Uk learned, didn't you?

20:25.098 --> 20:26.391
That he'd achieved Chisu.

20:27.976 --> 20:30.771
That's why you didn't hesitate
to bet yourself instead of the toad.

20:30.854 --> 20:33.065
Had Cha Beom competed
like he was supposed to,

20:33.732 --> 20:35.400
my young master would have won.

20:36.818 --> 20:38.487
He is no longer your young master.

20:40.364 --> 20:42.366
You will be serving Yul from now on.

20:45.244 --> 20:48.038
You said you two cared enough
about each other to risk your own lives.

20:49.373 --> 20:50.207
Fine.

20:51.291 --> 20:53.752
Continue to do that
while serving a new master.

20:55.254 --> 20:57.256
[soft music playing]

21:01.134 --> 21:02.010
[sighs]

21:16.400 --> 21:17.776
[Heo Yeom] Do not joke with me!

21:17.859 --> 21:20.153
How is it possible
you've reached Chisu already?

21:20.237 --> 21:22.864
I am telling you he really did.
I witnessed it.

21:23.532 --> 21:24.366
Is it true?

21:39.464 --> 21:41.425
[tranquil music playing]

21:43.802 --> 21:44.636
[Dang-gu gasps]

21:52.561 --> 21:54.271
- Yeah! [laughs]
- [grunts, groans]

21:55.564 --> 21:57.774
So, you are truly incredible, hah!

21:57.858 --> 21:59.401
Uk! You little…

21:59.484 --> 22:01.486
- Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!
- [Dang-gu] Oh! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

22:01.570 --> 22:02.612
[Heo Yeom laughs]

22:02.696 --> 22:04.364
That hurts! I'm in pain. Stop it!

22:04.948 --> 22:07.200
You stepped up
because you were worried that

22:07.284 --> 22:09.411
I'd end up serving Cha Beom, right?

22:09.494 --> 22:11.830
Thank you so much
for your kindness, Young Master Yul.

22:11.913 --> 22:13.707
In any case, you'll be serving me now.

22:14.875 --> 22:17.294
That was the condition
we set for the duel.

22:18.045 --> 22:20.297
- So, I need to pretend to keep that.
- Of course.

22:20.922 --> 22:24.426
Feel free to summon me anytime
if you need me to do anything.

22:24.509 --> 22:25.677
I will not need anything.

22:26.219 --> 22:28.347
You can visit Uk anytime you want.

22:30.307 --> 22:31.141
However…

22:32.976 --> 22:34.603
there is one thing I ask of you.

22:36.271 --> 22:39.566
Once I complete my training here
and return to Seoho Fortress,

22:40.567 --> 22:42.360
there is someone I'd like to take with me.

22:43.528 --> 22:45.322
When the time comes for that,

22:46.990 --> 22:47.949
please help me!

22:49.868 --> 22:52.245
I did not know you had someone like that.

22:52.329 --> 22:55.624
Promise me… you'll help when I need you.

22:58.960 --> 22:59.795
[inhales deeply]

22:59.878 --> 23:02.339
If you are requesting this as my master,

23:03.090 --> 23:05.050
I will do it at all costs.

23:06.259 --> 23:07.094
[laughs softly]

23:16.144 --> 23:19.314
Master Heo, there is
a soul shifter in Sejukwon.

23:19.397 --> 23:21.149
How could you have brought Uk there?

23:21.233 --> 23:23.568
He was hurt. What did you expect me to do?

23:24.152 --> 23:27.572
He's resting. I told him
not to move from the bed for a few days.

23:28.615 --> 23:30.659
- Is he hurt bad?
- Ugh.

23:30.742 --> 23:32.160
His wounds are not that serious.

23:33.495 --> 23:34.621
Reckless! [sighs]

23:34.704 --> 23:36.331
To spar with Yul!

23:36.998 --> 23:39.543
We should have just let him
continue fishing with Master Lee

23:39.626 --> 23:41.086
and not have summoned him back.

23:42.295 --> 23:46.550
However, it seems fishing is not
the only thing they did. Am I right?

23:46.633 --> 23:47.759
[laughs]

23:47.843 --> 23:51.054
Uk has already achieved Chisu.
Didn't you know?

23:52.055 --> 23:52.889
What?

23:52.973 --> 23:54.224
[laughs]

23:54.307 --> 23:55.767
I didn't believe it, either.

23:55.851 --> 23:58.562
It's amazing! He's just extraordinary.

23:58.645 --> 24:00.063
[cackles]

24:06.194 --> 24:09.489
- My lord.
- Uk, all this time,

24:10.365 --> 24:13.743
what have you been learning
while fishing at the lake

24:14.327 --> 24:15.954
alongside Master Lee?

24:17.664 --> 24:19.499
He taught me
how to catch the Golden Fish, sir.

24:19.583 --> 24:22.919
That just means he was
really determined to help you reach Chisu.

24:23.503 --> 24:26.590
- Has he taken you in as his pupil yet?
- [Jang Uk] It's nothing like that.

24:26.673 --> 24:28.633
There's a reason
why he cares about me so much.

24:29.634 --> 24:31.970
And what could that reason be?

24:33.180 --> 24:35.974
Has Master Lee perhaps…

24:36.725 --> 24:37.684
told you…

24:38.435 --> 24:40.729
anything? Anything at all?

24:42.647 --> 24:43.857
It was a family matter.

24:44.566 --> 24:46.985
So, I caught on first
and asked Master Lee all about it.

24:51.364 --> 24:54.451
It seems you are already aware of it.

24:56.995 --> 24:57.829
I hoped…

25:00.248 --> 25:01.791
you would not find out.

25:02.709 --> 25:03.543
Since then,

25:04.044 --> 25:07.255
I cannot possibly turn a blind eye.

25:08.673 --> 25:10.175
What will you do now…

25:14.721 --> 25:15.972
about Maid Kim?

25:17.682 --> 25:19.684
[quirky music playing]

25:24.522 --> 25:25.815
What about Maid Kim?

25:25.899 --> 25:28.360
Oh, Master Lee is being extra nice to me

25:28.443 --> 25:30.612
because he wants to
look good for Maidservant Kim.

25:31.988 --> 25:33.490
So what will you do for me now, my lord?

25:35.367 --> 25:37.994
Master Lee is a good man
and has helped me out a lot.

25:38.078 --> 25:39.246
But despite all that…

25:40.872 --> 25:41.706
given…

25:42.707 --> 25:46.127
our long history together,
I thought I'd be loyal,

25:46.211 --> 25:47.796
and give you the opportunity first.

25:51.633 --> 25:53.009
What opportunity?

25:53.093 --> 25:54.052
[sighs]

25:54.135 --> 25:57.222
Did you know Master Lee has been staying
at my house this whole time?

25:57.305 --> 26:00.934
[laughs] I was wondering
where he was staying, yeah.

26:01.017 --> 26:04.312
- So he stayed with you. [laughs]
- Yes.

26:04.396 --> 26:07.565
I'm willing to bet that they're having
a romantic dinner at my house as we speak.

26:07.649 --> 26:10.360
Maidservant Kim has
a soft heart, does she not?

26:10.443 --> 26:12.320
You know that she loves
feeding and providing for others.

26:12.404 --> 26:15.573
It is only a matter of time
before she falls for him.

26:15.657 --> 26:16.825
[both laugh]

26:16.908 --> 26:18.618
I truly hope

26:18.702 --> 26:21.538
she marries a loving man
and lives happily ever after.

26:22.706 --> 26:24.082
- [Jin groans softly]
- [Jang Uk] Uh…

26:24.916 --> 26:26.543
if it is okay with you, my lord.

26:27.377 --> 26:30.213
I mean I… I really want
to encourage their relationship.

26:35.135 --> 26:36.511
Yeah. [laughs]

26:38.722 --> 26:40.765
[dramatic stinger plays]

26:43.893 --> 26:46.730
Master Lee is unbelievably older than her.

26:47.314 --> 26:50.567
But on the outside,
he looks younger than you, you know.

26:50.650 --> 26:51.776
[Jin] It is still absurd.

26:52.277 --> 26:54.821
He practices chastity for his training.

26:56.406 --> 26:58.116
How could they possibly get married?

26:58.700 --> 27:02.245
[Heo Yeom] I had cut off
my libido as well, but I've recovered.

27:02.329 --> 27:03.872
It is not impossible.

27:03.955 --> 27:05.999
Does marriage involve only one?

27:07.250 --> 27:09.210
Maid Kim should want it as well.

27:09.294 --> 27:10.962
She is someone who…

27:11.963 --> 27:15.717
has remained steadfast with…
one person in her heart.

27:16.384 --> 27:17.761
[exclaims] Jin.

27:18.470 --> 27:20.638
Do you really still think that

27:20.722 --> 27:24.434
Maid Kim is in love with Jang Gang
of all people after all this time?

27:26.436 --> 27:28.730
I know Maid Kim the best more than anyone.

27:29.314 --> 27:32.192
So please, don't make such assumptions.

27:34.402 --> 27:35.904
[sighs]

27:36.821 --> 27:38.865
You say others lack common sense

27:38.948 --> 27:40.992
but you are the one who is lacking, huh?

27:41.493 --> 27:42.869
You know nothing! You fool!

27:43.453 --> 27:46.039
It's been forever! Idiot!

27:55.131 --> 27:57.133
[somber music playing]

28:10.980 --> 28:12.107
It was…

28:13.858 --> 28:15.151
him that day, also.

28:18.780 --> 28:19.906
[maid Kim exhales]

28:19.989 --> 28:21.491
It's freshly-made quince tea.

28:21.991 --> 28:23.660
- It smells nice.
- [chuckles]

28:24.869 --> 28:27.330
[Master Lee] It's not good to keep
withered flowers at home.

28:27.831 --> 28:30.083
It's not easy to find good flowers now.

28:30.792 --> 28:32.710
But if you say they're no good,
I'll throw them out.

28:34.045 --> 28:37.674
Having flowers in the house
makes me feel less lonely.

28:50.103 --> 28:51.896
[gasps, chuckles]

28:51.980 --> 28:55.024
I completely forgot about the cups
and only brought the kettle.

28:55.108 --> 28:55.942
[laughs]

29:00.822 --> 29:01.656
[gasps]

29:01.740 --> 29:03.116
How did they come back to life?

29:04.784 --> 29:06.578
Did Master Lee do this just now?

29:06.661 --> 29:07.495
[breathes excitedly]

29:08.538 --> 29:09.372
How beautiful!

29:09.456 --> 29:11.207
[chuckles, inhales]

29:26.765 --> 29:27.599
It was…

29:28.975 --> 29:31.227
Master Lee who gave her those flowers…

29:32.854 --> 29:34.439
on that day, also.

29:43.072 --> 29:45.575
You are truly kind and warm-hearted.

29:46.451 --> 29:47.285
Am I?

29:48.286 --> 29:50.371
Feel free to stay here
as long as you want.

29:50.914 --> 29:52.624
I will take good care of you.

29:54.417 --> 29:55.418
Thank you so much.

29:58.630 --> 30:01.132
Was that woman Jang Gang's wife?

30:03.468 --> 30:06.638
It is. She was very lovely.

30:06.721 --> 30:10.391
She must be the woman
Yeom told me Jin used to be in love with.

30:13.978 --> 30:16.856
She hasn't withered.
She's as beautiful as ever.

30:17.649 --> 30:19.025
Perhaps that is why…

30:20.819 --> 30:23.112
he still has not forgotten about her.

30:24.948 --> 30:25.782
Or maybe…

30:27.116 --> 30:28.618
he just doesn't fancy me.

30:29.577 --> 30:30.703
I don't know what to think.

30:36.835 --> 30:38.920
I understand that
it was the Crown Prince's command.

30:39.003 --> 30:41.256
But how can he forbid Mu-deok
from coming to see me?

30:41.339 --> 30:43.174
She must be worried sick about me.

30:43.258 --> 30:45.844
[Dang-gu] I'm sure she's just busy.

30:45.927 --> 30:47.720
I told her already
you were doing just fine.

30:47.804 --> 30:48.721
[Jang Uk] I mean…

30:48.805 --> 30:51.224
how can she be relieved
from just hearing it?

30:51.850 --> 30:52.934
She needs to see me.

30:54.185 --> 30:55.603
Uh, come here.

30:56.646 --> 30:57.480
[grunts]

30:58.064 --> 30:59.983
Seeing her will only hurt you.

31:02.193 --> 31:05.989
I use this homing bird to send letters
to my family in Seoho Fortress.

31:06.072 --> 31:06.990
[cooing]

31:08.950 --> 31:12.912
If it's Seoho Fortress, even a fast horse
will take three to four days to get there.

31:12.996 --> 31:14.664
Does it really fly that far?

31:15.248 --> 31:16.374
Incredible!

31:17.417 --> 31:18.334
[laughs softly]

31:22.589 --> 31:24.591
[soft music playing]

31:29.345 --> 31:30.972
Do you still have the whistle I gave you?

31:32.056 --> 31:34.684
Oh, I'm sorry. I did not carry it with me.

31:37.979 --> 31:40.315
It was given to you
by the person you are in love with.

31:40.398 --> 31:41.274
I'm quite hurt.

31:51.910 --> 31:54.829
Make two long blows on this whistle,
and the homing bird will return.

31:56.122 --> 31:57.540
You seemed to be pretty good at this.

31:58.124 --> 31:59.042
Would you like to try?

32:02.462 --> 32:04.464
["Just Watching You"
by Jeong Se-woon playing]

32:27.695 --> 32:28.529
[Mu-deok] Oh.

32:29.030 --> 32:30.198
Look!

32:33.326 --> 32:34.702
The bird is returning now.

32:35.954 --> 32:37.080
[laughs softly]

32:37.163 --> 32:38.748
Now, try doing two short ones.

32:40.583 --> 32:42.543
[whistling]

32:50.093 --> 32:51.219
[chuckles softly]

33:01.646 --> 33:03.940
[Mu-deok] I just said those things
to put him at ease.

33:04.524 --> 33:07.235
He was worried that his bird
might have struggled during the winter,

33:08.152 --> 33:09.779
so I told him those things.

33:12.323 --> 33:14.826
See? I told you she's doing fine.

33:19.038 --> 33:20.415
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait. Uk.

33:21.165 --> 33:24.377
What was that thing the Crown Prince
and Mu-deok originally bet on?

33:24.460 --> 33:25.837
The thing you said you had to get back.

33:28.798 --> 33:30.425
I lost, so it doesn't matter anymore.

33:31.843 --> 33:32.677
Uh…

33:37.682 --> 33:41.644
But, honestly though, how can she
just not care about losing it?

33:44.897 --> 33:46.399
[sighs]

33:49.944 --> 33:50.778
[Dang-gu] Lose what though?

33:50.862 --> 33:52.155
- Then, what did she lose?
- [Jang Uk] It doesn't matter.

33:52.739 --> 33:56.367
How come you've never visited Uk at all
when you know he is in Sejukwon?

33:57.785 --> 34:00.538
There's no need to worry about it.
I don't mind if you see him.

34:01.372 --> 34:02.874
That is not why.

34:03.666 --> 34:05.585
I'm just trying not to be shameless.

34:17.305 --> 34:19.724
[Go Won] So you really don't care
if you lose this then?

34:23.311 --> 34:25.897
[Mu-deok]
I need to find it. Find it tonight.

34:27.190 --> 34:28.024
[sighs]

34:28.107 --> 34:30.526
Only after will I be able to face Uk.

34:42.997 --> 34:43.998
[Beom] I knew it.

34:45.792 --> 34:46.834
[chuckles]

34:47.502 --> 34:49.003
He's practicing chastity.

34:49.087 --> 34:50.379
[all laugh]

34:50.463 --> 34:52.924
I knew something was suspicious
when Uk beat the Crown Prince,

34:53.007 --> 34:56.803
when he's been someone who ran away
after dishonoring the name of a mage.

34:56.886 --> 34:58.721
He chose to become Master Lee's pupil,

34:59.347 --> 35:01.099
- so he had to practice chastity.
- Mm.

35:01.182 --> 35:02.600
You all saw Master Lee?

35:03.184 --> 35:04.602
He was Master Seo Gyeong's pupil,

35:04.685 --> 35:06.479
and Master Heo was his pupil.

35:06.562 --> 35:08.689
But he looks younger than our leader.

35:09.273 --> 35:11.192
That's because he practiced chastity.

35:11.275 --> 35:13.111
From what I hear, he doesn't get old

35:13.194 --> 35:15.113
because he reached
such a high level at a young age.

35:15.196 --> 35:18.199
Really? I heard he became
young again with a secret spell.

35:18.282 --> 35:19.200
[mage] Oh, a spell?

35:19.283 --> 35:22.203
Who cares? Uk sure is determined.

35:22.286 --> 35:23.579
So what if he's reached Chisu?

35:24.330 --> 35:25.665
No matter how desperate,…

35:26.707 --> 35:27.708
[chuckles]

35:27.792 --> 35:30.169
- …I could never…
- [all laugh]

35:30.253 --> 35:31.671
Of course not. Me neither.

35:31.754 --> 35:33.756
- He's way too determined.
- Seriously.

35:33.840 --> 35:35.216
- [laughs]
- [mage] Should I?

35:35.299 --> 35:36.217
[sighs]

35:37.301 --> 35:38.928
These people are just jealous.
[clicks tongue]

35:39.554 --> 35:40.388
[exhales]

35:40.471 --> 35:43.766
Young Master Jang is subjected
to all sorts of terrible rumors.

35:44.809 --> 35:45.643
Gosh!

35:47.603 --> 35:48.437
[exhales]

35:51.691 --> 35:52.900
So, lately,

35:53.734 --> 35:57.155
I was able to get some much-needed sleep
thanks to this physician.

35:59.824 --> 36:02.952
I'm glad that your herbal medicine
was effective, Young Lady Heo.

36:03.995 --> 36:07.498
I used valerian that grows
in the wetlands of Wol Fortress.

36:07.582 --> 36:09.375
It is known for its calming effect.

36:09.458 --> 36:13.087
It must have helped you relax
so you could sleep much better.

36:13.796 --> 36:16.257
I can see why Master Heo recommended you.

36:17.717 --> 36:20.178
Thankfully, now I'm able
to get some sleep.

36:20.261 --> 36:23.556
But the ringing in my ears
and the headache still remain.

36:23.639 --> 36:26.017
Ever since you were startled
by the soul shifter incident,

36:26.100 --> 36:27.894
these occurrences have got much worse.

36:27.977 --> 36:30.521
A soul shifter tried to enter the palace.

36:30.605 --> 36:33.441
There is a good chance
that there's one in here now as we speak.

36:34.025 --> 36:35.443
[Go Won] Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu

36:35.526 --> 36:37.528
has strengthened security, so don't worry.

36:37.612 --> 36:40.239
The soul shifter who tried
to enter was one of Jin Mu's men.

36:41.032 --> 36:43.242
And lately, there have been rumors

36:43.326 --> 36:45.161
of a soul shifter
being seen in Cheonbugwan.

36:46.996 --> 36:48.748
I simply cannot trust anyone.

36:50.249 --> 36:51.292
[sighs]

36:51.375 --> 36:54.503
It seems like your symptoms
might stem from your heart, Majesty.

36:55.129 --> 36:58.591
You should find another way
to calm yourself other than medicine.

36:59.759 --> 37:03.137
By any chance,
do you happen to know Master Lee?

37:03.221 --> 37:05.264
The last direct pupil
of Master Seo Gyeong.

37:05.848 --> 37:07.934
Yes, of course, I know him.

37:08.017 --> 37:09.977
But I only met him once before in Songrim.

37:10.770 --> 37:14.982
My grandfather was his pupil,
so I've heard many stories about him.

37:15.066 --> 37:19.028
He may be able to find
other ways of relieving your anxiety.

37:20.071 --> 37:21.822
Are you saying that he can tell

37:21.906 --> 37:23.991
if there is a soul shifter nearby?

37:24.075 --> 37:26.619
I can't say for sure
because I don't know him that well.

37:26.702 --> 37:30.331
But I would recommend inviting Master Lee
to the palace and asking him for yourself.

37:33.209 --> 37:34.210
[sighs]

37:36.754 --> 37:38.589
I told you to clean her room every day!

37:38.673 --> 37:41.217
So why is my daughter's vase
full of dirty water?

37:41.300 --> 37:43.469
- [both exclaim]
- Sorry, my lady!

37:44.387 --> 37:48.140
Imagine if Bu-yeon returns
and saw this vase full of dirty water.

37:48.224 --> 37:49.892
How disappointed would she be
in her mother?

37:49.976 --> 37:51.018
[sighs]

37:51.102 --> 37:52.061
Change the bedsheets,

37:52.645 --> 37:53.604
and get rid of that!

37:54.105 --> 37:56.065
She can't see,
so why would you place that there

37:56.148 --> 37:57.483
and risk her tripping?

37:57.566 --> 37:59.568
[Cho-yeon breathes heavily]

38:10.746 --> 38:12.915
Dozens of girls have come and gone,

38:14.125 --> 38:15.501
but none of them were Bu-yeon.

38:16.168 --> 38:18.754
Having been disappointed
over and over again

38:18.838 --> 38:20.381
has made Mother more sensitive.

38:20.464 --> 38:21.590
I have to agree.

38:22.633 --> 38:25.553
But very soon,
it's gonna be your birthday.

38:28.556 --> 38:31.309
- Here.
- What is this?

38:33.644 --> 38:34.478
[Cho-yeon gasps]

38:34.562 --> 38:37.815
Father, it wasn't anything malicious.

38:38.691 --> 38:40.776
But it is not my birthday yet.

38:40.860 --> 38:43.487
I will get you
something prettier on your birthday.

38:43.571 --> 38:44.989
[chuckles]

38:45.072 --> 38:48.034
I'll put it on now. Please, do it for me.

38:48.951 --> 38:50.036
Yes.

38:54.373 --> 38:58.252
Let me see how pretty
my daughter is today.

38:58.919 --> 39:02.590
When I was younger,
you used to always braid my hair.

39:07.261 --> 39:11.057
Mother has never done
anything like this for me.

39:11.849 --> 39:13.434
- [yells]
- Sorry, sweetheart.

39:13.517 --> 39:15.436
I'm sorry. Did that hurt?

39:15.519 --> 39:17.646
[breathes deeply] I'm all right.

39:19.190 --> 39:21.150
[ominous music playing]

39:32.161 --> 39:34.205
It's been a long time
since I did your hair,

39:34.830 --> 39:36.832
I must have lost my touch. Sorry.

39:36.916 --> 39:40.002
That's all right. How do I look, though?

39:40.628 --> 39:42.254
As pretty as ever, sweetheart.

39:43.714 --> 39:44.548
[chuckles]

39:45.257 --> 39:47.218
[ominous music continues playing]

40:15.788 --> 40:17.832
So, this is the bow Park Jin used.

40:20.543 --> 40:22.086
[Mu-deok] I lost that day.

40:22.169 --> 40:25.548
The outcome of a fight cannot be
argued or changed.

40:28.092 --> 40:30.010
But once I regain my strength,

40:31.011 --> 40:33.556
I would like to have
a proper fight with Jin.

40:45.985 --> 40:47.069
[Jin] What are you doing?

40:48.654 --> 40:50.072
I'm cleaning, my lord.

40:52.658 --> 40:54.034
Be careful what you touch.

40:54.702 --> 40:57.872
Touch a belonging filled with the energy
of a high-degree mage,

40:57.955 --> 41:00.749
and a girl like you could even get hurt.

41:02.376 --> 41:04.587
Even a girl like me is aware of that.

41:05.171 --> 41:08.382
But I did wonder how
a high-degree mage expects me to clean

41:08.466 --> 41:11.051
if he leaves
such a thing just lying around.

41:11.135 --> 41:13.637
I usually make sure
to hang it up properly.

41:14.972 --> 41:16.140
I just forgot this time.

41:16.223 --> 41:17.516
You are still quite young.

41:18.017 --> 41:20.936
I can't believe that
you're already so forgetful.

41:22.313 --> 41:25.566
I'm beginning to worry.
I also belong to Songrim.

41:25.649 --> 41:28.652
What if the leader becomes senile
and forgets to pay me?

41:29.445 --> 41:30.529
My lord.

41:30.613 --> 41:33.949
You are still young.
I hope you stay healthy, okay?

41:37.411 --> 41:39.538
I will come back later and clean, my lord.

41:42.500 --> 41:43.542
[Jin chuckles softly]

41:46.420 --> 41:48.547
What a clever and…

41:49.423 --> 41:50.591
daring young girl.

41:51.717 --> 41:53.260
How did Mu-deok

41:53.344 --> 41:56.347
and Jang Uk first meet each other?

41:56.430 --> 41:57.932
I'm not too sure about that,

41:58.015 --> 42:01.852
but I heard he paid her debt
and took her from Chwiseonru, perhaps.

42:01.936 --> 42:03.562
Then go to Chwiseonru.

42:04.188 --> 42:06.690
Talk to everyone that you can find there.

42:07.483 --> 42:11.028
Find out exactly who she is.

42:12.196 --> 42:13.864
And let me know everything.

42:17.451 --> 42:19.370
[Ju-wol]
Sorry, I don't know her well either.

42:19.453 --> 42:22.498
But the broker who brought her here
is in the capital at the moment.

42:22.581 --> 42:25.000
If I see him, I'll tell him
to go to Songrim.

42:27.795 --> 42:29.421
[thug] Hey, broker man.

42:31.382 --> 42:32.424
[broker Kim sniffles]

42:32.508 --> 42:34.218
We met before, am I right?

42:34.802 --> 42:36.512
What… do you want now?

42:36.595 --> 42:37.763
So-i.

42:37.846 --> 42:39.473
Have you seen her in the capital?

42:40.307 --> 42:42.601
Do you know of anywhere she would be?

42:42.685 --> 42:45.771
I don't know.
She is not from Sari Village.

42:46.355 --> 42:49.108
She's a thieving bastard
who ran after stealing from the villagers.

42:49.692 --> 42:51.068
Let me know if you catch her.

42:52.278 --> 42:54.572
[exhales angrily, growls]

42:56.073 --> 42:58.492
Where can I find this girl?

42:59.868 --> 43:00.744
[exhales angrily]

43:02.413 --> 43:03.247
Damn it.

43:04.206 --> 43:06.166
So-i, that… awful girl.

43:08.085 --> 43:11.088
There's no way
she has gone to find Mu-deok.

43:14.633 --> 43:16.510
[Jin Mu] I will take you to Jinyowon soon.

43:17.303 --> 43:19.888
But there is something
we need to take care of first.

43:21.432 --> 43:23.851
[girls moaning]

43:26.020 --> 43:27.730
[both yelping]

43:29.815 --> 43:32.276
Here. Have this at least.

43:32.359 --> 43:34.528
Hey! You stole my purse, didn't you?

43:34.612 --> 43:35.863
Give me my ring back.

43:35.946 --> 43:37.323
[women yelping]

43:38.616 --> 43:40.576
[whimpering, breathing heavily]

43:41.577 --> 43:44.371
Are they the ones you met
when you were going to the capital?

43:44.455 --> 43:47.499
Yes, they are. What made you
want to bring them over here?

43:47.583 --> 43:50.294
I love how persistent and smart you are.

43:50.878 --> 43:52.755
That's what makes you dangerous, though.

43:53.922 --> 43:55.924
There's something I must show you.

43:57.009 --> 43:59.011
[ominous music playing]

44:12.775 --> 44:13.942
[woman] My lord.

44:14.485 --> 44:17.446
Thank you so much for feeding me.
It's much appreciated.

44:19.615 --> 44:21.617
[ominous music continues playing]

44:30.459 --> 44:31.627
[whimpering]

44:38.175 --> 44:39.927
[muffled yelping]

44:42.388 --> 44:43.764
[gasps]

44:49.311 --> 44:51.689
[pants]

44:54.108 --> 44:56.110
[suspenseful music playing]

45:19.007 --> 45:19.925
Be afraid.

45:20.551 --> 45:24.471
If you ever betray me or get caught,
you'll meet the same fate.

45:29.309 --> 45:30.310
[chuckles softly]

45:30.394 --> 45:31.228
Now…

45:32.354 --> 45:34.815
tell me if anyone else who might know you.

45:35.482 --> 45:36.650
I must get rid of them.

45:36.733 --> 45:37.609
[breathes heavily]

45:38.318 --> 45:39.653
Is there anyone else?

45:43.657 --> 45:44.575
Yes.

45:48.203 --> 45:51.331
[Go Won] Hey! Search thoroughly.
I definitely threw it in there.

45:51.874 --> 45:53.250
Ugh, I don't see it.

45:53.834 --> 45:56.128
Well, tr-try searching over there again.

45:56.211 --> 45:58.964
I searched that area before,
but there was nothing.

45:59.047 --> 46:01.800
- Well, just do it again.
- I can't see anything in this…

46:03.385 --> 46:04.428
Yes, Royal Highness.

46:05.137 --> 46:06.638
[Eunuch Oh] It should be here somewhere.

46:07.181 --> 46:08.849
Yes, yes, look there, over there.

46:13.228 --> 46:14.771
Uh, what are you doing?

46:14.855 --> 46:15.689
Uh…

46:16.982 --> 46:18.275
Doesn't concern you. Go away!

46:19.443 --> 46:22.404
[Mu-deok] I am afraid Eunuch Oh
will go through a lot of trouble.

46:23.071 --> 46:26.658
So I must say something, unfortunately.
Will you let me say it?

46:26.742 --> 46:28.285
What is it now? What?

46:28.368 --> 46:29.620
[inhales deeply]

46:29.703 --> 46:30.662
Could you…

46:31.705 --> 46:32.664
possibly…

46:33.582 --> 46:35.125
be looking for this?

46:36.710 --> 46:37.711
You found the jade?

46:37.794 --> 46:41.215
I literally searched
all day and night and finally found it.

46:45.844 --> 46:47.262
You already threw it away, didn't you?

46:47.930 --> 46:50.516
Since I picked it up,
it's mine once again.

46:51.183 --> 46:52.017
Oh, jeez.

46:54.895 --> 46:57.272
Eunuch Oh, you can come out now. Go on.

46:58.607 --> 46:59.650
Yes, Your Highness.

47:01.401 --> 47:02.277
Damn it.

47:03.070 --> 47:06.907
Thanks to you tossing it,
I retrieved something precious.

47:06.990 --> 47:10.077
Your Highness, I owe you once again.

47:11.828 --> 47:12.704
Right.

47:12.788 --> 47:16.291
I did not destroy it
or throw it too far away.

47:16.875 --> 47:19.336
You were only able to retrieve it
because I threw it nearby.

47:19.419 --> 47:23.340
I dared to try and figure out
Your Royal Highness's intent,

47:23.423 --> 47:28.136
and I think you're all grumpy in trying
to take credit for everything

47:28.220 --> 47:30.264
because you feel bad
about what you did to me.

47:30.889 --> 47:33.850
You, as Filthy Mu-deok,
ought to just listen to what I say.

47:33.934 --> 47:35.727
How dare you try
to understand the Crown Prince?

47:35.811 --> 47:38.355
Oh, no. I apologize, Your Highness.

47:41.149 --> 47:42.150
[Beom] Your Highness.

47:46.029 --> 47:48.031
Your Highness. I have news for you.

47:48.115 --> 47:50.826
Master Heo told me to tell you
that Master Lee is here.

47:50.909 --> 47:53.078
All right. Is he at Sejukwon?

47:53.161 --> 47:55.914
Yes. His pupil, Jang Uk,
is with him also, Royal Highness.

47:58.417 --> 48:00.836
[Beom] They're saying
Uk is improving so quickly

48:00.919 --> 48:02.838
due to Master Lee's
bizarre training methods.

48:02.921 --> 48:04.673
[Hyo] If that had not been the case,

48:04.756 --> 48:06.883
he would not have been able
to hold a candle to you, Sire.

48:09.970 --> 48:10.846
Let's go.

48:22.941 --> 48:25.444
So, you are now serving Yul instead of Uk.

48:26.069 --> 48:27.946
Had I competed and beat Uk,

48:28.572 --> 48:30.282
you would have been serving me instead.

48:30.365 --> 48:32.159
Had you competed instead of Yul,

48:32.868 --> 48:35.871
there would have been
no chance of me serving you.

48:35.954 --> 48:38.665
If I'd fought him, I would have let him
win the duel out of pity.

48:39.249 --> 48:40.584
[Beom] Do you not pity him?

48:40.667 --> 48:44.755
Everyone in Songrim knows
that Uk is practicing chastity.

48:45.339 --> 48:47.174
- Right?
- [Beom] Don't play ignorant.

48:47.257 --> 48:48.550
You have to know better.

48:49.134 --> 48:53.180
Are you not the one who brews
and serves him chaste tea every day?

48:53.263 --> 48:54.348
I have never done that.

48:54.431 --> 48:57.517
If that is not the case,
then how did Uk reach Chisu so fast?

48:58.977 --> 49:00.979
He is not even Jang Gang's real son.

49:02.314 --> 49:05.984
His mother married into the Jang family
and gave birth to an illegitimate son.

49:06.735 --> 49:09.946
Now, her bastard son will get to end
the family line for good.

49:10.030 --> 49:10.864
[all laugh]

49:10.947 --> 49:12.449
[Yeol] His father blocked
his gate of energy so that

49:12.532 --> 49:14.493
he couldn't carry on the family line.

49:14.576 --> 49:17.537
But he managed to open it again,
so he should practice chastity.

49:17.621 --> 49:19.206
- [all laugh]
- [Hyo] Gosh.

49:20.832 --> 49:24.044
How obnoxious and despicable!

49:24.127 --> 49:24.961
What?

49:27.089 --> 49:28.256
What did you just say?

49:29.508 --> 49:32.177
- You heard what I said.
- How dare you say that?

49:32.678 --> 49:35.222
- Try saying that again.
- If I do, you'll hit me.

49:35.305 --> 49:36.556
I dare you say it again.

49:38.934 --> 49:40.102
[Go Won] Tell them what you said.

49:50.487 --> 49:53.198
If they really want to hear it,
then make sure you go ahead

49:53.281 --> 49:55.575
and let them know
what you think loud and clear.

50:01.456 --> 50:04.459
You are obnoxious and despicable!

50:06.503 --> 50:09.047
That is what she said. Did you get that?

50:09.673 --> 50:10.507
[all] Yes, Your Royal Highness.

50:11.550 --> 50:14.344
Mu-deok, you have something
I once gave you.

50:14.428 --> 50:15.429
[Go Won] Show them.

50:17.055 --> 50:19.349
[quirky music playing]

50:22.477 --> 50:24.229
I bestowed that sachet to you.

50:24.312 --> 50:28.442
If someone hits you, swears at you,
or treats you badly while I am not around,

50:28.525 --> 50:30.318
you must come and let me know.

50:31.695 --> 50:32.529
Yes.

50:34.614 --> 50:35.866
You may go now.

50:45.083 --> 50:47.210
You should never
make an enemy out of somebody

50:47.711 --> 50:49.379
just because you are jealous and angry.

50:50.255 --> 50:51.298
It's foolish.

51:00.724 --> 51:02.350
You have ink on your shoulder, Beom.

51:03.059 --> 51:05.771
You can erase that black ink
with hot rice paste.

51:07.022 --> 51:09.107
The two colors may contrast one another.

51:09.941 --> 51:12.110
But when they mix together,
that stain disappears.

51:13.195 --> 51:14.488
Those are such wise words.

51:15.447 --> 51:17.866
Where did you read that, Your Highness?

51:19.326 --> 51:20.243
Oh, just somewhere.

51:20.827 --> 51:23.079
Something you'd see
on a highly competitive exam.

51:23.163 --> 51:23.997
[Go Won] Hmm.

51:33.965 --> 51:34.841
[pants]

51:37.552 --> 51:39.262
Is my young master not here?

51:42.849 --> 51:45.393
[Yun-ok] I heard you were injured.
Are you better now?

51:46.311 --> 51:49.272
[Jang Uk] Yes, thanks to you.
Thank you for sending me the medicine.

51:50.148 --> 51:52.317
Oh. Just a few days ago,

51:52.400 --> 51:55.362
Maidservant Kim invited me
over for dinner.

51:56.696 --> 51:59.783
I was wondering
if you could possibly join us?

51:59.866 --> 52:01.660
Ah, yes.

52:02.577 --> 52:03.703
[laughs softly]

52:03.787 --> 52:06.039
Then I will set a date
and pass it on to you

52:06.122 --> 52:07.582
through your servant.

52:07.666 --> 52:09.084
Oh, do you know Mu-deok?

52:09.167 --> 52:12.295
There was a day when I was
waiting in your room to meet you

52:12.379 --> 52:13.922
but ended up having to leave.

52:14.714 --> 52:17.259
I happened to meet Mu-deok
that day in your room.

52:17.342 --> 52:18.301
Ah.

52:23.014 --> 52:23.932
[Mu-deok] Stop.

52:25.350 --> 52:27.143
Don't go to your room and stay here.

52:28.103 --> 52:29.896
I will go and bring your clothes.

52:31.982 --> 52:32.983
Wait, uh…

52:33.900 --> 52:34.901
so was that a hint?

52:35.777 --> 52:37.320
What do you mean?

52:38.488 --> 52:40.073
Oh, it is nothing.

52:40.156 --> 52:41.783
[both chuckle nervously]

52:45.579 --> 52:47.414
- [bee buzzing]
- [yells]

52:47.497 --> 52:48.915
- Wait. [chuckles]
- [Yun-ok groaning]

52:49.833 --> 52:51.835
- Hold on, hold on. Stay still. Stay still.
- [Yun-ok] It's right in front of me.

52:52.752 --> 52:54.629
It's gone. It's gone. [laughs]

52:54.713 --> 52:56.089
- It is gone?
- Mm-hmm. Yes, it's gone.

52:56.798 --> 52:58.133
[both laugh]

52:58.216 --> 52:59.885
- [Jang Uk] It flew away.
- [Yun-ok] It startled me.

53:08.810 --> 53:09.895
[clears throat]

53:13.231 --> 53:14.316
Mu-deok.

53:30.624 --> 53:32.959
Hello, Mu-deok, we meet again.

53:36.379 --> 53:37.797
[Yun-ok] Please, take care of yourself.

53:38.340 --> 53:39.674
I will see you at the palace.

53:39.758 --> 53:41.092
Oh, yes.

53:54.564 --> 53:56.274
What is it now? Did you run here?

53:57.233 --> 53:58.109
I did.

53:58.193 --> 53:59.778
It took you long enough
to finally visit me

53:59.861 --> 54:00.862
when you knew I was hurt.

54:00.946 --> 54:01.905
What is it?

54:01.988 --> 54:04.157
Did something else happen to you
after your master changed?

54:04.240 --> 54:05.200
No.

54:05.283 --> 54:07.243
The other mages were gossiping about you.

54:07.327 --> 54:08.453
I wanted the truth.

54:08.536 --> 54:10.914
Hmm, right. I see.
So you heard about it also.

54:10.997 --> 54:12.749
Why rush over when you know it's untrue?

54:12.832 --> 54:16.127
Who knows? You even caught
a Golden Fish while I was away.

54:16.878 --> 54:19.047
You could be practicing
chastity with Master Lee.

54:19.130 --> 54:21.257
What? Hey, come on!
That's absolutely ridiculous.

54:21.341 --> 54:22.384
Never mind!

54:22.968 --> 54:24.386
I recommended him to you.

54:25.261 --> 54:26.888
I guess I can't be mad about it.

54:26.972 --> 54:28.848
Ugh, how am I going to prove it to you?

54:30.016 --> 54:31.351
Wait, I have an idea.

54:35.397 --> 54:37.649
[soft music playing]

54:41.152 --> 54:42.153
How about that?

54:43.530 --> 54:44.572
[clicks tongue]

54:44.656 --> 54:46.074
You don't see me as a woman.

54:46.157 --> 54:49.202
If you want to prove it,
go embrace a pretty lady like Yun-ok.

54:50.578 --> 54:52.622
Okay, fine. Should I really do it?

54:53.915 --> 54:55.875
Go on! Just go for it.

54:55.959 --> 54:57.627
I'll do it. So, don't go
changing your mind later.

54:57.711 --> 54:59.087
All right. Go ahead!

55:03.758 --> 55:05.760
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

55:34.330 --> 55:35.415
You told me to strike

55:36.082 --> 55:38.585
when my opponent doesn't anticipate
any kind of attack.

55:39.627 --> 55:42.505
Your pupil has successfully
followed your teaching.

55:45.800 --> 55:48.553
Good. Well done. I'm proud of you.

55:50.472 --> 55:51.848
[clicks tongue] By the way,

55:52.640 --> 55:56.311
I heard that you ran into Yun-ok
in my room last time.

55:58.480 --> 55:59.564
What about it?

55:59.647 --> 56:01.357
Is that why you stopped me
from going in there?

56:05.153 --> 56:06.696
Did that really happen?

56:07.530 --> 56:08.740
I don't remember that at all.

56:08.823 --> 56:09.657
[Jang Uk sighs]

56:09.741 --> 56:11.826
Compared to controlling
Gyeongcheondaeho's energy,

56:11.910 --> 56:13.286
understanding you is much harder.

56:14.746 --> 56:16.498
That was a hint you sent, right?

56:19.000 --> 56:21.503
Master, I'm going to the palace today.

56:21.586 --> 56:23.463
The King invited Master Lee over,

56:24.089 --> 56:26.174
and I will be accompanying him as well.

56:26.257 --> 56:28.885
I did want to get another look
at the Queen, so it works out.

56:29.636 --> 56:31.179
Please be safe, all right?

56:32.472 --> 56:35.308
Hmm. I'll tell you how it went, okay?

56:39.854 --> 56:40.688
Hmm.

56:43.274 --> 56:44.317
Jang Uk.

56:48.613 --> 56:49.906
I found the jade.

56:51.658 --> 56:55.662
I just happened to find it on the ground.
I figured I'd let you know.

56:56.996 --> 56:57.831
[chuckles softly]

56:57.914 --> 56:58.915
Go.

57:00.375 --> 57:01.417
Uh…

57:04.295 --> 57:05.338
[chuckles softly]

57:11.094 --> 57:11.970
[chuckles]

57:18.268 --> 57:20.603
Why would the leader of Songrim
look for me?

57:21.646 --> 57:23.731
You do remember Mu-deok, right?

57:23.815 --> 57:26.818
He wants to know
about the time she spent in Sari Village.

57:26.901 --> 57:30.155
Goodness! Why ask me?
He could just ask her.

57:30.238 --> 57:31.197
I mean she's here.

57:31.281 --> 57:33.741
No, she's not. She's in Songrim now.

57:33.825 --> 57:34.659
She is?

57:35.743 --> 57:38.580
What could a blind girl
possibly be doing in Songrim?

57:40.874 --> 57:43.418
[Sang-ho] Master Lee wants
you two and Uk to be the mages

57:43.501 --> 57:45.336
to accompany him to the palace.

57:46.504 --> 57:47.839
So, Uk is going, too?

57:48.673 --> 57:50.467
Huh? Is he better now?

57:50.550 --> 57:52.427
We must leave right now.
You should go get ready.

57:52.510 --> 57:54.512
[suspenseful music playing]

58:00.727 --> 58:03.396
Please, be careful when you arrive.

58:03.480 --> 58:05.857
The ice stone should be there
in the palace.

58:05.940 --> 58:06.774
[chuckles softly]

58:07.525 --> 58:09.110
I'm well aware of that.

58:09.194 --> 58:11.738
Since they are shamelessly
hiding the ice stone,

58:12.447 --> 58:15.408
I have decided to be brazen also,
and make my move.

58:20.997 --> 58:23.333
The last time I was invited to the palace…

58:24.167 --> 58:26.586
- [Jin] I remember.
- You know, Jin, you were this little.

58:27.128 --> 58:30.089
Oh, yes. I really enjoyed
eating the candies

58:30.173 --> 58:31.925
that you'd brought
from the palace that day.

58:32.592 --> 58:33.760
By the way,

58:34.344 --> 58:37.972
is it really okay not to prepare
a gift for His Majesty?

58:38.056 --> 58:39.557
I have prepared one already.

58:40.099 --> 58:40.975
Yeom.

58:41.059 --> 58:43.895
Send the gift I requested
over to the palace on time.

58:43.978 --> 58:45.522
[Heo Yeom] Yes, master.

58:45.605 --> 58:47.190
Between 5:00 and 7:00 at night?

58:47.273 --> 58:49.275
Between 7:00 and 9:00 at night!

58:49.359 --> 58:51.653
- Right. So sorry.
- [sighs]

58:51.736 --> 58:54.531
- Write it down so you will not forget.
- Ah, of course.

58:54.614 --> 58:56.157
[Master Lee] You were easily
distracted as a youth.

58:56.241 --> 58:59.160
Now that you've aged, I see that
you've become forgetful as well.

58:59.244 --> 59:00.328
[Heo Yeom laughs awkwardly]

59:00.411 --> 59:02.539
[inhales] Let's just go.

59:03.081 --> 59:04.749
- Goodbye, master.
- [Jin] Goodbye, master.

59:05.959 --> 59:08.920
Oh, guys. I can't get used to those two.

59:11.214 --> 59:12.465
[Heo Yeom sighs]

59:12.549 --> 59:14.509
[suspenseful music playing]

59:36.531 --> 59:37.782
[clears throat] Mu-deok.

59:39.993 --> 59:41.869
The leader would like you
to go see him now.

59:43.329 --> 59:44.539
The leader, you said?

59:53.423 --> 59:54.257
Mu-deok.

59:54.924 --> 59:56.884
[ominous music playing]

01:00:07.645 --> 01:00:12.150
This man just told me
everything about you.

01:00:13.109 --> 01:00:16.696
I told him all about your eyes
and how you were blind.

01:00:21.284 --> 01:00:23.077
[Mu-deok] Will my cover get blown?

01:00:24.454 --> 01:00:27.123
Uh, my lord, you see…

01:00:28.708 --> 01:00:31.127
She wasn't the only one who lied.

01:00:32.462 --> 01:00:36.132
Her grandmother insistently begged me,
so I played along.

01:00:36.924 --> 01:00:39.844
Her family has always been poor.

01:00:40.428 --> 01:00:42.305
She lied about being blind to avoid being…

01:00:42.889 --> 01:00:44.766
sold off to pay the debt.

01:00:45.433 --> 01:00:47.644
You know, some people pretend to be limp

01:00:47.727 --> 01:00:49.687
to avoid fighting in war, right?

01:00:49.771 --> 01:00:53.566
Why did you say you were blind
when you were sold off to Chwiseonru?

01:00:56.110 --> 01:00:58.029
[broker Kim] She was planning to run away.

01:00:59.280 --> 01:01:01.115
She may have been sold off
due to the debt.

01:01:01.199 --> 01:01:04.077
But it's so much easier
to pretend to be blind.

01:01:05.286 --> 01:01:07.622
- Right?
- Yes, that's correct.

01:01:07.705 --> 01:01:11.292
I was on the run
when I first met Young Master Jang.

01:01:11.376 --> 01:01:13.878
He pitied me and took me
into the Jang family.

01:01:16.923 --> 01:01:19.092
I sincerely apologize for lying, my lord.

01:01:20.301 --> 01:01:21.552
I was wrong.

01:01:22.887 --> 01:01:24.347
[broker Kim] Aside from lying
about being blind,

01:01:24.430 --> 01:01:26.224
she has never done anything wrong.

01:01:26.307 --> 01:01:30.061
Mu-deok has always been
a good granddaughter and a kind girl.

01:01:41.823 --> 01:01:43.991
Thanks for the help,
but why did you lie for me?

01:01:45.076 --> 01:01:48.037
I just did my money's worth. That's all.

01:01:48.621 --> 01:01:49.622
Your money's worth?

01:01:52.667 --> 01:01:55.002
By the way, are you actually not blind?

01:01:56.796 --> 01:01:58.131
[laughs]

01:01:58.214 --> 01:01:59.090
Of course not!

01:01:59.173 --> 01:02:02.635
I did find it odd you said
you were blind in the first place.

01:02:03.720 --> 01:02:05.430
- What?
- Despite being blind,

01:02:05.513 --> 01:02:08.099
you could always recognize
who was in front of you,

01:02:08.182 --> 01:02:10.226
whether it would rain or snow and so on.

01:02:10.810 --> 01:02:13.312
Back in the village,
some people didn't really like you

01:02:13.396 --> 01:02:15.314
since they thought
you were lying about being blind

01:02:15.398 --> 01:02:18.109
and were conspiring something suspicious.

01:02:19.444 --> 01:02:20.486
Oh, I see.

01:02:20.570 --> 01:02:24.365
Anyways, come to the ferry inn
if you ever need my help again. All right?

01:02:25.575 --> 01:02:26.409
Ah.

01:02:27.118 --> 01:02:29.328
Almost forgot. Did you meet with So-i?

01:02:30.496 --> 01:02:31.581
So-i?

01:02:31.664 --> 01:02:33.040
She's in the capital right now.

01:02:33.750 --> 01:02:35.543
Some thugs were looking for her.

01:02:35.626 --> 01:02:38.045
I wonder what mischief she is up to.

01:02:38.129 --> 01:02:42.175
After all, she was the one who robbed
your house after your grandmother passed.

01:02:42.258 --> 01:02:46.554
It is better that
you try not to get involved with her.

01:02:48.431 --> 01:02:51.642
You said you did your money's worth.
So, who paid you?

01:02:51.726 --> 01:02:52.810
Ju-wol.

01:02:57.732 --> 01:02:59.025
There's no need to thank me.

01:02:59.734 --> 01:03:01.569
It was Young Master Jang's money.

01:03:02.570 --> 01:03:04.030
[playful music playing]

01:03:06.240 --> 01:03:08.785
Just in case, though.
If anyone comes to you asking for Mu-deok

01:03:08.868 --> 01:03:11.120
or start looking for her by any chance

01:03:11.204 --> 01:03:12.330
use this money to deal with it.

01:03:13.498 --> 01:03:16.083
Oh, and also, half is yours, of course.

01:03:16.667 --> 01:03:19.670
It is not like I was hiding
or doing anything too heinous.

01:03:19.754 --> 01:03:21.005
And I got my share.

01:03:21.756 --> 01:03:22.632
[clears throat]

01:03:22.715 --> 01:03:24.550
Plus, I do like you a lot, Mu-deok.

01:03:25.551 --> 01:03:27.220
I am truly grateful.

01:03:27.303 --> 01:03:30.014
But what really happened to your eyes?

01:03:35.061 --> 01:03:36.187
Never mind. [sighs]

01:03:36.270 --> 01:03:37.814
You must have your reasons.

01:03:42.527 --> 01:03:44.737
[Mu-deok] If I had been taken
to Park Jin like that,

01:03:44.821 --> 01:03:46.823
he could have found out everything.

01:03:48.074 --> 01:03:51.702
If I get caught now,
I'll also be putting Uk in danger.

01:03:52.995 --> 01:03:54.580
[eerie music playing]

01:04:05.341 --> 01:04:07.260
Welcome, Master Lee Cheol.

01:04:08.177 --> 01:04:10.471
I am grateful
for your invitation, Your Majesty.

01:04:12.723 --> 01:04:14.475
[eunuch Kim] Did that wench Shaman Choi

01:04:15.226 --> 01:04:16.894
order you to kill me?

01:04:20.439 --> 01:04:21.691
[Jang Uk] Shaman Choi.

01:04:22.441 --> 01:04:24.193
Could that be the Queen's true identity?

01:04:30.783 --> 01:04:31.617
Mu-deok.

01:04:32.118 --> 01:04:33.369
[pants]

01:04:34.871 --> 01:04:36.831
That So-i he was talking about,

01:04:37.707 --> 01:04:40.334
she could have been the one
who was looking for you a few days ago.

01:04:41.586 --> 01:04:43.713
She's very dangerous,
just watch out for her, okay?

01:04:47.133 --> 01:04:49.468
[Mu-deok] How can I watch out for her
if I've never seen her?

01:04:50.595 --> 01:04:52.597
Should I have asked that man
in more detail?

01:04:53.389 --> 01:04:56.100
Come to the ferry inn
if you ever need my help again.

01:04:57.226 --> 01:04:58.769
The ferry inn.

01:05:05.359 --> 01:05:08.988
[Jin] This man just told me
everything about you.

01:05:10.865 --> 01:05:12.867
[suspenseful music playing]

01:05:22.501 --> 01:05:23.628
[innkeeper] Let me see.

01:05:25.630 --> 01:05:26.631
That's done.

01:05:28.174 --> 01:05:30.551
Is Broker Kim from Sari Village here?

01:05:30.635 --> 01:05:32.386
Yes, second floor.

01:05:32.970 --> 01:05:33.971
[innkeeper] Last room.

01:05:40.353 --> 01:05:43.439
Mr. Kim, it's Mu-deok.

01:05:58.079 --> 01:06:00.081
[tense music playing]

01:06:10.383 --> 01:06:11.300
Mr. Kim.

01:06:24.271 --> 01:06:25.314
[Sun] But Master Lee,

01:06:25.815 --> 01:06:28.192
if you were Master Seo Gyeong's pupil,

01:06:28.693 --> 01:06:30.736
you must be well over a century old.

01:06:30.820 --> 01:06:33.447
How are you able to maintain
such a youthful appearance?

01:06:34.031 --> 01:06:37.159
How old do you think
I look to you, Your Majesty?

01:06:38.369 --> 01:06:43.582
You look like you could be in your…
mid-thirties or forty at most.

01:06:44.417 --> 01:06:48.087
This body of mine is indeed
the real age that you guessed.

01:06:49.005 --> 01:06:49.964
[Sun] What?

01:06:50.047 --> 01:06:52.842
It is my soul that is over a century old.

01:06:53.426 --> 01:06:56.387
My old body has turned to ash,
and this body I'm in now

01:06:56.470 --> 01:06:59.181
did not belong to me
originally as you see.

01:07:01.392 --> 01:07:02.268
[Sun] Wait, then…

01:07:03.019 --> 01:07:05.312
does that mean you have
switched bodies with someone else?

01:07:05.855 --> 01:07:06.731
That's right.

01:07:07.898 --> 01:07:10.276
I am a soul shifter.

01:07:10.359 --> 01:07:12.611
[dramatic music playing]

01:07:18.951 --> 01:07:19.785
Your Majesty.

01:07:20.327 --> 01:07:24.457
Did you not summon me today
to find the soul shifter?

01:07:25.041 --> 01:07:26.000
I will do that.

01:07:26.876 --> 01:07:30.171
I can recognize any soul shifter.

01:07:30.796 --> 01:07:32.798
[tense music playing]

01:07:41.515 --> 01:07:45.311
[Jang Uk] Master Lee knew from the start
that Mu-deok was a soul shifter.

01:07:46.979 --> 01:07:48.981
[tense music continues playing]

01:08:10.711 --> 01:08:11.587
Oh.

01:08:12.797 --> 01:08:14.340
You killed this man.

01:08:14.965 --> 01:08:16.967
[dramatic music playing]

01:08:32.858 --> 01:08:34.860
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the Garden playing]

01:08:56.841 --> 01:08:58.551
[Mu-deok] What were all those bodies?

01:08:58.634 --> 01:09:01.053
What kind of life has Mu-deok led?

01:09:01.137 --> 01:09:04.723
[Jin] Mu-deok is definitely hiding
something that must not be revealed.

01:09:05.516 --> 01:09:06.809
[exclaims] Oh, my…

01:09:07.685 --> 01:09:10.312
It will instead let you know by barking.

01:09:10.396 --> 01:09:14.108
[Jang Uk] As we suspected, there're more
soul shifters within the palace.

01:09:14.191 --> 01:09:16.694
[Jin Mu] The King's Star being created
through sorcery

01:09:16.777 --> 01:09:19.655
would spell the end of Songrim.

01:09:19.738 --> 01:09:20.573
It's dangerous,

01:09:20.656 --> 01:09:23.242
because you do not know her,
but she does know Mu-deok.

01:09:23.325 --> 01:09:24.493
We need Jang Gang.

01:09:24.577 --> 01:09:27.079
We will have to wait
until he decides to return.

01:09:28.372 --> 01:09:29.206
What are you doing here?

01:09:29.290 --> 01:09:32.251
[Mu-deok] I cannot leave
Young Master Jang no matter what happens.

01:09:32.334 --> 01:09:33.878
[Jang Uk] I think it's better
if you stick to your confession

01:09:33.961 --> 01:09:35.504
and keep loving me to death.
